    'GAIA':'GAIA — terrain overlays, sensor geometry & geo tools',
    '◆ MAVEN':'◆ MAVEN — tasks, assets, COA, objects & places',
    '▹ Theater':'Theater — full-screen map focus (Esc to exit)',
    'Light/Dark':'Theme — toggle light / dark',
    'Close':'Close — dismiss this panel',
    'Toggle sidebar':'Toggle sidebar — collapse or expand navigation',
    'Collapse sidebar':'Collapse sidebar — hide the left nav to maximize map',
    'Switch MSS mode — Manual or Automatic':'MSS mode — switch Manual · full deck or Automatic · YONO autonomous',
    'MANUAL ↻':'MSS is Manual — operator in control, full deck',
    'AUTOMATIC ↻':'MSS is Automatic — YONO autonomous, directives on the map',
